CORE
bad-name-duplicate.btor2
--bound 0
^\[repeated\] : PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[repeated\$5\$\$\] : REFUTED$
^\[repeated\$5\] : PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[repeated\$5\$\] : PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Repeated labels must keep all bad nodes. An automatically generated
suffix must not replace a label present in the input.
